  <div style="padding:10px 12px;margin-bottom:8px;border-radius:4px;background:#f6f9f6;font-size:12px;">S1　<strong>制造费用送审预算 · 示例数据</strong><br><span style="font-size:11px;color:#788b81;">本次展示测试所用的固定预算样例。</span></div>
